  "html": "<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":2442,\"mediaLink\":\"https://divergentjournaler.com/?attachment_id=2442\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_0136-1024x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2442 size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Content…\"} -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Note to self : There are many reasons to use a dashboard, but for me its just for a visual moment of joy as I reach for a journal. The back is useles for the moment, but I love that my heart smiles when I am reminded of the day my daughter and I took this trail.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Supplies Used : Passport TN, Epson EcoTank, Procreate, Canva, Black Thread</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
